      "updated": 1780197404471,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "SLOT_EMPTY      0  → 空，可以写\nSLOT_READY      1  → 子进程写完，父进程可以发\nSLOT_INFLIGHT   2  → 父进程正在发送，网卡在用",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "SLOT_EMPTY      0  → 空，可以写\nSLOT_READY      1  → 子进程写完，父进程可以发\nSLOT_INFLIGHT   2  → 父进程正在发送，网卡在用",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
