      "updated": 1780197404471,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "+------------------------------------------------+\n|               共享内存槽位状态机                |\n+------------------------------------------------+\n\n         子进程获取空槽\n                ↓\n      SLOT_EMPTY ←───────────\n                │                      \n                │ 子进程写入数据        \n                ↓                      \n        SLOT_READY                     \n                │                      \n                │ 父进程发送线程取走    \n                ↓                      \n        SLOT_INFLIGHT                  \n                │                      \n                │ 网卡DMA发送完成       \n                ↓                      \n       CQ 发送完成事件                  \n                │                      \n                └───────────────\n                     标回 EMPTY",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "+------------------------------------------------+\n|               共享内存槽位状态机                |\n+------------------------------------------------+\n\n         子进程获取空槽\n                ↓\n      SLOT_EMPTY ←───────────\n                │                      \n                │ 子进程写入数据        \n                ↓                      \n        SLOT_READY                     \n                │                      \n                │ 父进程发送线程取走    \n                ↓                      \n        SLOT_INFLIGHT                  \n                │                      \n                │ 网卡DMA发送完成       \n                ↓                      \n       CQ 发送完成事件                  \n                │                      \n                └───────────────\n                     标回 EMPTY",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
