      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1780360645618,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1.读取配置的redis端口\n2.只处理配置端口的连接\n3.获取唯一的socket\n3.把socket加入BPF哈希表，让sk_skb生效\n也就是注册到流量处理链",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1.读取配置的redis端口\n2.只处理配置端口的连接\n3.获取唯一的socket\n3.把socket加入BPF哈希表，让sk_skb生效\n也就是注册到流量处理链",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
