    {
      "id": "xzq0cdFh3RRe0GHpZyzcE",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 4887.64329811186,
      "y": 4987.430216772834,
      "width": 475.8599548339844,
      "height": 125,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b3e",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1235441912,
      "version": 296,
      "versionNonce": 805914616,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1780362215417,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "kprobe：内核函数指针，内核上下文\n开销：极低，纳秒级损耗\n1.全程内核态运行，无状态切换\n2.旨在命中时触发，没触发无开销\n3.不需要解析应用ELF，不需要进程加载时重定位符号",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "kprobe：内核函数指针，内核上下文\n开销：极低，纳秒级损耗\n1.全程内核态运行，无状态切换\n2.旨在命中时触发，没触发无开销\n3.不需要解析应用ELF，不需要进程加载时重定位符号",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "y15Yse3zmWUK3prMTDDvD",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 4826.288736367615,
      "y": 5203.089067736817,
      "width": 592.2596080137937,
      "height": 179.0552236648482,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b3f",
      "roundness": {
        "type": 3
      },
      "seed": 1860178312,
      "version": 95,
      "versionNonce": 1339349496,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1780362231091,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false
    },
    {
      "id": "vV1ZeOzn53XYees4j6L1z",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 4868.861280641452,
      "y": 5220.640267030383,
      "width": 577.6400146484375,
      "height": 150,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b3g",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1963138952,
      "version": 465,
      "versionNonce": 1772831624,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1780362430469,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "uprobe：用户态指针，进程上下文\n开销：微秒级起步\n1.指令替换+cpu断点异常，内核执行到此地址是触发软件异常，\n切内核处理bpf，处理完切换回用户态，一次触发两次中断\n2.ELF符号解析开销，加载是解析应用elf，符号偏移，重定位\n3.独占进程上下文，被探测到就会被打断，高并发下损耗会被放大",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "uprobe：用户态指针，进程上下文\n开销：微秒级起步\n1.指令替换+cpu断点异常，内核执行到此地址是触发软件异常，\n切内核处理bpf，处理完切换回用户态，一次触发两次中断\n2.ELF符号解析开销，加载是解析应用elf，符号偏移，重定位\n3.独占进程上下文，被探测到就会被打断，高并发下损耗会被放大",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "ptKI3Bb-yASdilWieOgNq",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 4825.036573210508,
